> Design spec. Date: 2026-07-09. Platform: MDS-G4000-L3-4XGS.
> Part of Plan D (multi-subagent program). This is the FIRST sub-project (B).
> References: `~/plan-d-framework-agentx-subagent-notes.md`, `~/agentx_multi.md`,
